a/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/Cabin1a.png?etag=%2223a7ba-5f379bc0%22&sourceContentType=image%2Fpng&ignoreAspectRatio&resize=900%2B962&extract=0%2B0%2B661%2B962","variants":[{"label":"Standard","price":140,"optionIdx":2}],"explain":[{"term":"Yurt","meaning":"A round, tent-like cabin with a wooden floor."}]}],"includes":[],"addons":[],"gap":"Prices, hours and eligibility are not copied here yet. We will ask when you request.","blurb":"Our family oriented park is located right on Nimpo Lake near Bella Coola and has everything you’ll need. From RV sites to cabins and the possibility to camp with your tent.","cover":"https://impro.usercontent.one/appid/oneComWsb/domain/vagabondrvpark.ca/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/IMG_7403.jpeg?etag=%22296ad3-6a384ce6%22&sourceContentType=image%2Fjpeg&ignoreAspectRatio&resize=2752%2B1548&extract=0%2B0%2B2688%2B1548&quality=85","photos":["https://impro.usercontent.one/appid/oneComWsb/domain/vagabondrvpark.ca/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/IMG_7403.jpeg?etag=%22296ad3-6a384ce6%22&sourceContentType=image%2Fjpeg&ignoreAspectRatio&resize=2752%2B1548&extract=0%2B0%2B2688%2B1548&quality=85","https://impro.usercontent.one/appid/oneComWsb/domain/vagabondrvpark.ca/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/IMG_6321.jpg?etag=%22306ae5-610b5cf4%22&sourceContentType=image%2Fjpeg&quality=85&progressive","https://impro.usercontent.one/appid/oneComWsb/domain/vagabondrvpark.ca/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/IMG_3695.jpeg?etag=%22111764-6956d152%22&sourceContentType=image%2Fjpeg&ignoreAspectRatio&resize=1476%2B1107&extract=0%2B0%2B1476%2B876&quality=85","https://impro.usercontent.one/appid/oneComWsb/domain/vagabondrvpark.ca/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/IMG_6322.jpg?etag=%2224dd36-610b5cf2%22&sourceContentType=image%2Fjpeg&ignoreAspectRatio&resize=2452%2B1839&extract=184%2B0%2B2061%2B1839&quality=85","https://impro.usercontent.one/appid/oneComWsb/domain/vagabondrvpark.ca/media/vagabondrvpark.ca/onewebmedia/IMG_7678.jpeg?etag=%222d